"learn.topic.roles.gallery.1" = "The finishing role is visible, but the setup chain behind it matters just as much.";
"learn.topic.roles.gallery.2" = "The Tekong sets the emotional frame of the rally.";
"learn.topic.roles.gallery.3" = "At elite level, role clarity often decides who stays composed in long exchanges.";
