"learn.topic.matchiq.gallery.1" = "Modern Takraw creates visual drama instantly, but understanding requires context.";
"learn.topic.matchiq.gallery.2" = "Court geometry and team shape explain why some calm touches are actually elite.";
"learn.topic.matchiq.gallery.3" = "The highlight finish only makes sense when the previous two decisions are understood.";
